# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# ItChats AI — Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Core — Required
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=3092
HOST=0.0.0.0

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Database — Required
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PostgreSQL connection string. Format:
# postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:PORT/DATABASE
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://itchats:your_password@localhost:5432/itchats

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Redis — Required
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Redis connection URL. Used for caching, sessions, and queues.
# Default: localhost:6379 (no password needed in dev)
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  JWT Auth — Required
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
JWT_SECRET=generate-a-random-64-character-string-for-jwt
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=15m
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRES_IN=30d

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  AI Provider: Alibaba DashScope — Required
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Core AI backend for chat, image generation, TTS, ASR.
# Get your key at: https://dashscope.console.aliyun.com/apiKey
# Pricing: Pay-as-you-go (first 2M tokens/month free for some models)
# Without this: the entire app cannot function (no AI chat, no image gen, etc.)
ALIBABA_API_KEY=sk-your-alibaba-api-key
ALIBABA_BASE_URL=https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Stripe Payments — Optional
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required for: payments, credit purchases, subscriptions
# Get keys at: https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
# Free tier: no monthly fee — you only pay per-transaction fees
# Without this: payment features will be unavailable
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_your-stripe-secret-key
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_your-webhook-signing-secret
# STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_your-publishable-key  # (frontend only)

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  News API — Character Trend Search (Optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lets characters search for real-world news and trends,
# post their reactions, and stay current.
# Get your key at: https://newsapi.org/register
# Free tier: 100 requests/day, 500 results/request
# Without this: characters uses LLM to simulate trends instead
# NEWS_API_KEY=your-newsapi-key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Unsplash — Image Search for Trends (Optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Finds real stock photos to accompany trend/news posts.
# Get your key at: https://unsplash.com/developers (register as developer)
# Free tier: 50 requests/hour (demo tier)
# Without this: trend posts won't have images (text-only reactions)
# UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=your-unsplash-access-key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  S3 / Object Storage — Media Uploads (Optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Stores user uploads, generated images, videos, and audio.
# Options:
#   - AWS S3: https://aws.amazon.com/s3/ (5GB free, then pay-as-you-go)
#   - Cloudflare R2: https://www.cloudflare.com/r2/ (10GB free, zero egress)
#   - Backblaze B2: https://www.backblaze.com/b2/ (10GB free)
#   - MinIO: self-hosted (free, infinite)
#
# Without this: media storage / uploads won't work.
# Set S3_PUBLIC_URL if your bucket is publicly accessible, otherwise
# the app will use signed URLs automatically.
# S3_ENDPOINT=https://your-bucket.s3.amazonaws.com
# S3_ACCESS_KEY=your-s3-access-key
# S3_SECRET_KEY=your-s3-secret-key
# S3_BUCKET=itchats-media
# S3_REGION=us-east-1
# S3_PUBLIC_URL=https://your-bucket.s3.amazonaws.com

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  OAuth Providers — Optional
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google OAuth for social login.
# Get credentials at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Free: no cost for authentication
# Without this: Google login button won't appear
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-your-google-client-secret

# Apple Sign-In for iOS/macOS users.
# Get credentials at: https://developer.apple.com/account/resources/identifiers
# Free: included with Apple Developer Program ($99/year)
# Without this: Apple sign-in won't be available
# APPLE_CLIENT_ID=com.itchats.signin
# APPLE_TEAM_ID=your-10-char-team-id
# APPLE_KEY_ID=your-10-char-key-id
# APPLE_PRIVATE_KEY=-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Web Push Notifications — Optional
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Enable push notifications for browsers/mobile PWA.
# Generate VAPID keys: npx web-push generate-vapid-keys
# Without this: push notifications won't work
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:admin@itchats.ai
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=your-vapid-public-key
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=your-vapid-private-key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  CORS — Required (has defaults)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Origins allowed to call the API. Update these for production.
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3090
ADMIN_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3091

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  API Base URL — Optional
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public URL of the API; used for generating links in emails,
# webhook callbacks, and S3 redirects.
# API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3092

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Logging & Monitoring — Optional
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
LOG_LEVEL=debug
# Sentry error tracking — https://sentry.io (free: 5K errors/month)
# SENTRY_DSN=https://your-sentry-dsn@sentry.io/project-id
